<title>NORWAY: Orkla, Volvo to sell Hansa.</title>
<headline>Orkla, Volvo to sell Hansa.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Orkla ASA and Sweden's AB Volvo will sell Hansa brewery for 410 million Norwegian crowns to a group of investors with a view to having the company listed on the stock exchange, an Orkla statement said on Monday.</p>
</text>
